 elements by adjusting the z-index for connector lines and selection outlines.", "created_at": "2026-03-18T14:58:05Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8f3e0533bdb9486a2e1b671b15436bb1d9afd2b6", "message": "Update version to 1.3.4 in pyproject.toml and add GitHub Actions workflow for bumping minor version", "created_at": "2026-03-18T14:26:52Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5cdfaac4c7607847d938cfa4c3863a6e45904919", "message": "Refactor zoom connector and whisker calculation logic; add unit tests\n\n- Extracted zoom inset connector placement logic into `zoom_connector.py` for improved testability.\n- Introduced `compute_boxplot_whiskers` and `compute_render_scale` functions for whisker calculation and zoom scaling.\n- Updated `BoxPlot` and `Plot` classes to utilize the new functions.\n- Added unit tests for whisker calculations and zoom connector placement to ensure correctness.", "created_at": "2026-03-18T14:25:39Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ed1d5e61f2a415d4dca49783b6670f04f6ddf97f", "message": "Update version to 1.3.3 in pyproject.toml", "created_at": "2026-03-18T14:14:16Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "917f7dcf226ee68a5517da0c71ec619ff668a804", "message": "Implement visual scaling for plot elements in zoomed views\n\n- Added `getVisualScale` method in the `Window` class to retrieve the scale factor for visual elements.\n- Updated various classes (`Arrow`, `Bubble`, `Equation`, `Function2D`, `ParametricEquation`, `Points2D`) to utilize the new scaling method for line widths and sizes, ensuring consistent appearance in zoomed plots.\n- Enhanced `Plot` class to calculate and set the `renderScale` for zoom insets based on pixel density.\n- Added tests for zoom inset scaling to verify correct visual representation of elements.", "created_at": "2026-03-18T14:13:49Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1bbf59de0d2d5e427a6a7006e4de5e2167bba61d", "message": "Enhance legend handling in Window class and set zoom plot legend visibility\n\n- Updated `__addOuterContent__` method to conditionally set legend objects based on `showLegend` attribute.\n- Set `showLegend` to False for zoom plots in `standard.py` to improve plot clarity.", "created_at": "2026-03-18T14:06:27Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a925eba2e25cbb1743e3c10023fad89d9ecc4fef", "message": "Update version to 1.3.2 in pyproject.toml", "created_at": "2026-03-18T14:01:07Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "307494cd738589ffe39391203ad8d1beecaab5a2", "message": "Update font size calculation in zoom plot to ensure minimum value of 1", "created_at": "2026-03-18T14:00:59Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "113e073705d67912d8edd6a7126763cce13b3cda", "message": "Refactor BoxPlot whisker calculation to follow Tukey's convention\n\n- Updated whisker calculation to use lower and upper fences based on IQR.\n- Adjusted outlier detection logic to identify points outside the whisker range.\n- Ensured whiskers extend to the minimum and maximum data within the calculated fences.", "created_at": "2026-03-18T13:58:29Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f428769d551359a646ce3b28597c3be5334a6b45", "message": "Update version to 1.3.0, add zoom inset feature, and enhance testing framework\n\n- Updated version in `pyproject.toml` to 1.3.0.\n- Introduced `ZoomInset` class for magnified views in plots.\n- Added methods for handling zoom overlays and connections in `standard.py`.\n- Updated `.gitignore` to include regression test outputs.\n- Implemented a custom test runner and various test cases for zoom functionality.\n- Added new images for zoom tests and references.", "created_at": "2026-03-18T13:56:52Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a69c53ed95d4cbbe44b8d3e521dda49179856093", "message": "Added more test and prepared for text in 3d and 2d", "created_at": "2025-05-30T17:41:05Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "823923b63b1ba2f097f34b6afd044a5b19aa5ec3", "message": "v1.2.7", "created_at": "2025-05-24T14:51:26Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "90a250a97f15d0fc887e0deef40ab8f32f720c6d", "message": "Improved the transparency for 3D plots", "created_at": "2025-05-24T14:48:09Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d5499ff5c3dffe45a5eb5cc9ed7a83921fc7796c", "message": "v1.2.6", "created_at": "2025-05-14T15:23:47Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ef2456778ad6b8e4345ea80a7e157388ecbd8a3e", "message": "small improvements and bugfixes\n\n- Refactored `map.py` to improve readability and include more parameters\n- Fixed a bug in `pillar.py` and added more parameters\n- Changed `point.py` to allow for a single point", "created_at": "2025-05-14T15:22:02Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e6b2e4e33777730e5c3a614570ab0d83a6e7fb97", "message": "moved forceWidthHeight away from pos. docstring", "created_at": "2025-05-04T11:46:02Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8c6d569b981eb1eee0be824c02b3d59717c75f40", "message": "Added more settings to bubble", "created_at": "2025-05-04T11:41:59Z", "repo": "kaxe", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b29e5a1